OL,12,     GAntonia Quirke speaks to
OL,13,     Gcomposers who've scored original
OL,14,     Gmusic for Austen adaptations
OL,15,     Gabout their musical choices and
OL,16,     Galso about the music Austen
OL,17,     Genjoyed. Today: Rachel Portman.
